# Sequence todos and tickets so that prerequisite artefacts (preference)

Standing user preference: Sequence todos and tickets so that prerequisite artefacts (e.g. retrieved skills, curated datasets) are fully available before any ticket that depends on them is executed.

## Conventions
- Sequence todos and tickets so that prerequisite artefacts (e.g. retrieved skills, curated datasets) are fully available before any ticket that depends on them is executed.

